     "headline": "API 510 Repairs, Alterations and Rerating: Who Authorizes What",
     "name": "API 510 Repairs, Alterations & Rerating: Who Approves",
     "description": "API 510 repair vs alteration vs rerating: who authorizes the work, hold points, repair organizations, R-stamp and nameplate rules, with a roles matrix.",
