       "name": "What is the API 510 CUI temperature range?",
       "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The eleventh edition lists −12 °C (10 °F) to 177 °C (350 °F) for carbon and low-alloy steels, 60 °C (140 °F) to 177 °C (350 °F) for austenitic stainless, and 138 °C (280 °F) to 177 °C (350 °F) for duplex stainless. Intermittent service is included."
       }
