        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Your employer certifies you under its SNT-TC-1A written practice after you complete Level I and Level II classroom training, log documented experience, pass general, specific and practical exams administered under a Level III, and pass a vision test. Online classroom training can start before you are hired, with certification following once an employer documents your experience."
